            </div>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <div class="p-10 bg-[#FFF7ED] rounded-[28px] border border-orange-50 hover-card group">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#D35400] group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: 'Lora', serif;">Work-Related Stress</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Support for managing burnout, performance concerns, and professional challenges.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-10 bg-[#FFF7ED] rounded-[28px] border border-orange-50 hover-card group">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#D35400] group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: 'Lora', serif;">Relationship Concerns</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Professional support for navigating relationship dynamics and interpersonal challenges.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-10 bg-[#FFF7ED] rounded-[28px] border border-orange-50 hover-card group">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:bg-orange-500 transition-colors">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#D35400] group-hover:text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
